        },
        {
          "text": "Omu hali bo, omuntu anyakwetwa Agabo, yayemerra yarangisibwa Mwoyo nkooku harukwija kubaho kiihe omu nsi yoona. Niyo kiihe eyabaireho omu businge bwa Klahudiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.28"
            ]
          }
